 This is the source code of [Fizzy](https://fizzy.do/), the Kanban tracking tool for issues and ideas by [37signals](https://37signals.com).
 
 
+## Deploying to production
+
+You can run Fizzy yourself on a single Linux server with Docker, thanks to [Kamal](https://kamal-deploy.org). Fill in your host name, mail server, and secrets in [config/deploy.yml](config/deploy.yml) and run `bin/kamal setup`. See our [Deployment guide](docs/deployment.md) for the details.
+
+
 ## Development
 
 You are welcome -- and encouraged -- to modify Fizzy to your liking.
